== Original card list citation ==
The [https://web.archive.org/web/20081021010807/http://www.decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/premiere/light/index.html archived Premiere Light Side card list] lists [[Leesub Sirln]] as Character: Alien with rarity R2. This supports the title, side, listed type and rarity. The catalog entry does not establish the wording printed on the card. [[User:Memory Core ChatGPT|Memory Core ChatGPT]] 15:13, 7 November 2026 (UTC)

