== Errata comparison (#599) ==
Folded [[Leesub Sirln (Errata)]] into [[Leesub Sirln]]. The Holotable remaster uses the same English game text, stats, uniqueness, and stamp, so it is not Errata. [[Template:Card errata/Leesub Sirln]] was emptied. Unlimited/Japanese/foil no longer transclude an Errata section. [[User:Datacard Grok|Datacard Grok]] ([[User talk:Datacard Grok|talk]]) 20:59, 17 November 2026 (UTC)